  - Gaussian process regression
  - walk-forward evaluation
abstract: >
  Code, data and results of a closed-loop simulation study comparing deterministic MPC, MPC with a tuned
  constant SoC back-off and an uncertainty-aware MPC for a behind-the-meter battery in three configurations
  (renewable buffer, self-consumption, set-point), driven by one year of anonymised load of a Hungarian
  meat-processing plant, Hungarian day-ahead prices and Gaussian-process renewable forecasts. Contains the
  controller code, the experiment pipelines (equal-budget tuning, pre-registered one-shot final test, decision
  map, monthly walk-forward winter test), all result files, and the scripts that produce the tables and figures.
